   "hash": "d6616c1d",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.6.2#p1-6f71074c",
     "text": "To give, and occupy for the use of him that gave it.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "fellowship"
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.6.2#p2-dc63fd85",
     "text": "By any deceit, or unlawful means.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "violence"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.6.3",
   "range": "LEV.6.3",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "033cb14b",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.6.3#p1-033cb14b",
     "text": "In which he cannot but sin: or, in which a man accustoms to sin by perjury or such like thing.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "sinning therein"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.6.9",
   "range": "LEV.6.9",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "29264036",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.6.9#p1-29264036",
     "text": "That is, the ceremony which ought to be observed in it.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "law of the burnt offering"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.6.10",
   "range": "LEV.6.10",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "27d5f9e6",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.6.10#p1-104f70b2",
     "text": "Upon his secret parts, Ex 28:42.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "his flesh",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Ex 28:42",
       "ref": "EXO.28.42"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.6.10#p2-97d56481",
     "text": "In the ash pans appointed for that use.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "altar"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.6.17",
   "range": "LEV.6.17",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "a14bd5e9",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.6.17#p1-a14bd5e9",
     "text": "Or, kneaded with leaven and baked.",
     "label": "g",
     "anchor": "baken with leaven"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.6.20",
   "range": "LEV.6.20",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "d9aa4f00",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.6.20#p1-d9aa4f00",
     "text": "So oft as the high priest shall be elected and anointed.",
     "label": "h",
     "anchor": "perpetual"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.6.22",
   "range": "LEV.6.22",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "de90ee5b",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.6.22#p1-de90ee5b",
     "text": "His son that shall succeed him.",
     "label": "i",
     "anchor": "anointed in his stead shall offer"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.6.27",
   "range": "LEV.6.27",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "fe4dfca9",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.6.27#p1-fe4dfca9",
     "text": "Meaning, the garment of the priest.",
     "label": "k",
     "anchor": "garment"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.6.28",
   "range": "LEV.6.28",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "81b3de19",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.6.28#p1-81b3de19",
     "text": "Which was in the laver, Ex 30:28.",
     "label": "l",
     "anchor": "water",
     "refs": [
      {
